# Bags Directory

Place your ROS bag files (`.bag`) here.

These files are ignored by git to keep the repository lightweight.

## How to add bag files

```bash
# Copy from your local machine
cp /path/to/your/file.bag ./

# Copy from a USB drive
cp /media/<username>/<drive_name>/*.bag ./
```

Inside the Docker container, this directory is mounted at `/ros_ws/bags/`.
